  <text xml:lang="grc"><body xml:base="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.rizotomoi.dindorf1893-grc1"><div type="edition" n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.rizotomoi.dindorf1893-grc1" xml:lang="grc" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_rizotomoi"><head>ΡΙΖΟΤΟΜΟΙ</head><div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="479" xml:id="fragment-rizotomoi-dindorf1893_grc1-479" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_rizotomoi">
            <note type="source">Macrobius Saturnal. V, 19.</note>
            <quote>Sophoclis autem tragædia id, de quo quærimus, etiam titulo præfert. Inscribitur enim Ῥιζοτόμοι, in qua Medeam</quote>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="480" xml:id="fragment-rizotomoi-dindorf1893_grc1-480" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_rizotomoi" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.rizotomoi.nauck1889grc1:492">
            <note type="source">Schol. Apollonii Rhodii II, 1213.</note>
            <quote>Ὅτι δὲ ἡ Ἑκάτη δρυΐνῳ κλάδῳ στέφεται καὶ δράκουσι καὶ Σοφοκλῆς ἐν Ῥιζοτόμοις παρεισάγει τὸν χορὸν λέγοντα</quote>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Ἥλιε δέσποτα</l>
              <l n="2" xml:lang="grc">καὶ πῦρ ἱερὸν, τῆς εἰνοδίας</l>
              <l n="3" xml:lang="grc">Ἑκάτης ἔγχος, τῷ δι᾽ Ὀλύμπου</l>
              <l n="4" xml:lang="grc">πολλὴ φέρεται καὶ γῆς, καίουσ᾽</l>
              <l n="5" xml:lang="grc">ἱερὰς τριόδους, στεφανωσαμένη</l>
              <l n="6" xml:lang="grc">δρυσὶ καὶ πλεκτοῖς</l>
              <l n="7" xml:lang="grc">ὠμῶν σπείραισι δρακόντων.</l>
            </lg>
            <note>4. ναίουσ' codex Vaticanus.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="481" xml:id="fragment-rizotomoi-dindorf1893_grc1-481" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_rizotomoi">
            <note type="source">Hesychius,</note>
            <quote>Ἀϊστώσας: διαχέας καὶ τήξας.</quote>
            <note>Brunckius κόρην ἀϊστώσας πυρί.</note>
          </div>
        </div></body></text></TEI>
